NEW_SECTION
The v4.0.0-beta section now also records everything on this branch after commit
98d8799 ("optimized SPAEngine module 010"):

"Added" gains 10 bullets: DataView module; modal stacking; SPAEngine named route
params and route exit hook; the doc/ documentation set; the three runnable examples
(spa, modal, form); the SPA example's DataView table page; CLAUDE.md and the
changelog/<feature>/ logging convention; the FormComponents guide and example.

"Fixed" gains 27 bullets: SPAEngine (boolean link attributes/addToHistory/flag
leaks; history storing the path literal; dynamic pattern segment-count matching),
ProgressIndicator (default space resolution; timer leak and style 3 re-show),
ModalDisplayer (nesting state destruction; the seven crash/leak fixes from the
stacking work; body reflow on open/close; overlay left anchor), the module registry
cleanup, and the 16 FormComponents bullets (module, CSS and cosmetic fixes).

"Changed" gains 1 bullet: the modal scroll lock mechanism moving from
position:fixed to body overflow:hidden.

REASON
Requested roll-up of all changes after commit 98d8799 into the release-level
ChangeLog.md, following its existing v4.0.0-beta Added/Fixed/Changed bullet
pattern. Sources: the 14 commit messages 98d8799..HEAD and the per-feature logs
under changelog/ (modal-stacking follow-ups modal-scroll-lock and
modal-example-expansion, form-components-docs, form-components-fixes,
form-components-example) for the uncommitted work.
